rocess of unlife in a crude human scale mockery of the Wyrm's own descent into Madness!<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, CtD20 will feature Pentex, a heartless mega-corporation run by Dauntain (a whole concept that needs revisiting and proper expansion, really) who seek to spare innocent childlings the sadness and horrors of awakening to their fae heritage. Mindlessly violent video-games rot away creativity, plastic dolls enshrine consumerism over passion, and insipid role-playing games turn imagination in rote mathematical exercises. The fiends must be stopped!<br /> <br /> Wraith can have the Inquisition. Bloody church can't handle the idea of their afterlife being a lie, so now they have to send out their secret agents to cover up the truth, or worse yet, enslave ghosts to their own purposes. Sure, many are trying to do what they think is the right thing - but tell yourself that as you undergo the excruciating pain of an exorcism or as your wedding dress is burned to ashes by the Latin-chanting bastards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T19:14:13-08:00","id":333676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/270888-wraith-20th-anniversary-edition-vs-orpheus?p=333666#post333666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View P